<title>JAPAN: Japan July-Sept steel output seen up yr/yr -- MITI.</title>
<headline>Japan July-Sept steel output seen up yr/yr -- MITI.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's crude steel production in the July-September period is expected to total 26.05 million tonnes, the Ministry of International Trade and Industry (MITI) said on Monday.</p>
<p>The estimated figure for the July-September period is up 7.6 percent from the same quarter last year, but down 2.4 percent from the previous quarter, MITI said in a statement.</p>
<p>MITI officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
